{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112780/extras/b48fb0652a8de30f6c0b0f838d499d76.avif?t=1771880621\" width=750 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112780/extras/987449ea47f98e14116bca45493326e9.webp?t=1771880621\" width=54 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the classical Warcraft and Starcraft custom maps TD Classic brings that maze building experience with a clean UI and art style. You will gain gold by defeating enemies and use that gold to expand and upgrade your maze from a choice of 3 base towers, 6 upgrade paths and 3 tiers to defeat 100's of waves across 10 maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112780/extras/fb23f3f14e889de86c95a30c903ee2bb.webp?t=1771880621\" width=96 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >34 enemy types including 8 bosses with their own abilities, art and stats requiring careful planning of your maze and the towers you chose to build and upgrade. Each of the 8 bosses also have their own unique abilities to account for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112780/extras/a6171476d509ad2c2b586861b22515f6.avif?t=1771880621\" width=123 height=75 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4112780?t=1771880621","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4112780?t=1771880621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/411